---

---

<section
  id="about"
  class="section-padding bg-page overflow-hidden"
  aria-label="Tentang Pitcar Academy"
>
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <span
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-50 text-secondary font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-brand-200 mb-6"
        >
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
          Bukan Sekadar Belajar di Kelas
        </span>
        <h2 class="heading-primary mb-6">
          Belajar Mekanik Harus Bertemu dengan <span
            class="text-primary italic"
            >Dunia Bengkel Sebenarnya</span
          >
        </h2>
        <div
          class="w-16 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary rounded-full mb-6"
        >
        </div>
        <p
          class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5"
        >
          Mengetahui teori otomotif saja belum cukup untuk membangun kepercayaan
          diri sebagai mekanik profesional.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-extrabold text-lg mb-4">
          Karena itu Pitcar Academy menggabungkan:
        </p>

        <!-- Premium Timeline Flow -->
        <div class="relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-primary/20 space-y-6 my-8">
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <!-- Dot Indicator with Number -->
            <div
              class="absolute -left-[35px] top-1 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-[10px] font-black flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-page shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
            >
              1
            </div>
            <div
              class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl text-white"
            >
              <h3 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Belajar</h3>
              <p
                class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-1 font-medium leading-relaxed"
              >
                Materi dan metode pembelajaran dikembangkan berdasarkan
                pengalaman operasional PITCAR dalam menangani kendaraan
                pelanggan sehari-hari.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <div
              class="absolute -left-[35px] top-1 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-[10px] font-black flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-page shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
            >
              2
            </div>
            <div
              class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl text-white"
            >
              <h3 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">Praktik</h3>
              <p
                class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-1 font-medium leading-relaxed"
              >
                Porsi pembelajaran dirancang agar peserta memiliki banyak
                kesempatan memegang alat, melakukan pemeriksaan, memahami
                komponen, & mengerjakan kendaraan secara langsung.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <div
              class="absolute -left-[35px] top-1 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary text-white text-[10px] font-black flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-page shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
            >
              3
            </div>
            <div
              class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl text-white"
            >
              <h3 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">2 Bln OJT</h3>
              <p
                class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-1 font-medium leading-relaxed"
              >
                Menjalani OJT di lingkungan bengkel PITCAR untuk menghadapi dan
                membiasakan diri dengan ritme serta standar pekerjaan bengkel
                yang sebenarnya.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 4 -->
          <div class="relative group">
            <div
              class="absolute -left-[35px] top-1 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary text-white text-[10px] font-black flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-page shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
            >
              4
            </div>
            <div
              class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl text-white"
            >
              <h3 class="font-extrabold text-white text-base">
                Pengalaman Bengkel Nyata
              </h3>
              <p
                class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-1 font-medium leading-relaxed"
              >
                Membentuk kesiapan kerja yang utuh dengan portofolio riil,
                pemecahan masalah langsung di lapangan, serta pengenalan budaya
                kerja profesional.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-muted italic">
          📲 Batch perdana dimulai Oktober 2026 dengan kuota terbatas untuk
          menjaga kualitas pembelajaran.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-transparent to-secondary/10 rounded-[2rem] blur-2xl pointer-events-none"
        >
        </div>
        <img
          src="/mechanic-practice.webp"
          alt="Peserta Pitcar Academy sedang praktik di lingkungan bengkel PITCAR"
          class="relative w-full aspect-4/3 md:aspect-square object-cover rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800"
          width="800"
          height="800"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-3 sm:left-4 bg-white/95 dark:bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
            <div
              class="w-11 h-11 bg-brand-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"
            >
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="22"
                height="22"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="#CC0000"
                stroke-width="2.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                ><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg
              >
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-extrabold text-white text-sm sm:text-base">
                Ekosistem PITCAR
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400">
                Materi & Metode dari Operasional Bengkel Nyata
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
